# Repo-pinned sha256 digests for the Nerd Fonts release assets pinned in
# config/nerdfonts.list, as `<hex>  <asset>@<version>`. Upstream ships no
# per-asset checksums; these are recorded from the pinned release archives at
# pin time so the network and assets/fonts paths stay verified. Regenerate
# whenever config/nerdfonts.list pins a new version.
